.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SS "template<uint32_t dim>
.br
class csmp::NodeCenteredFiniteVolumeTransport< dim >"base class for node-centered generic finite volume calculations on an entire \fBModel\fP object 


.PP
\fBAuthor\fP
.RS 4
S\&.K\&. Matthaei 
.RE
.PP
\fBDate\fP
.RS 4
2008
.RE
.PP
Generic transport module for CVFE computations on poly-element-type finite element (-finite-volume) meshes\&. Computations are done using an implicit or semi-implicit approach that is only weakly depedent on the grid-Courant number\&.

.PP
A range of constructors allows to build the module for first-order, second-order conservative and non-conservative transport simulations including source and sink terms\&.

.PP
\fBTodo\fP
.RS 4
(1) Bring theta-limited space time second-order accurate scheme back to work (A) 
.RE
.PP

