.SS "template<uint32_t dim> void \fBcsmp::NodeCenteredFiniteVolumeTransport\fP< dim >::FluxBalance (double & fmin, double & fmax) const"

.PP
for each finite volume it sums up incoming and outgoing fluxes reporting the extrema Method loops over FLUX_BALANCE \fBvector<double>\fP determining min/max values\&.

